requested as part of <span\n+       data-x=\"following hyperlinks\">following a hyperlink</span> whose <a href=\"#linkTypes\">link\n+       types</a> include the <code data-x=\"rel-noreferrer\">noreferrer</code> or <code\n+       data-x=\"rel-noopener\">noopener</code> keyword, or as part of executing <code\n+       data-x=\"dom-open\">window.open()</code> whose <code data-x=\"\">features</code> argument\n+       contains the <code data-x=\"rel-noopener\">noopener</code> keyword:</dt>\n+       \n+       <dd><p>A new <span>top-level browsing context</span> must be <span\n+       data-x=\"creating a new browsing context\">created</span>. If the given browsing context name\n+       is not <code data-x=\"\">_blank</code>, then the new top-level browsing context's name must be\n+       the given browsing context name (otherwise, it has no name). The chosen browsing context must\n+       be this new browsing context. The creation of such a <span>browsing context</span> is <dfn>a\n+       new start for session storage</dfn>.</p>\n+\n+       <p class=\"note\">If it is immediately <span data-x=\"navigate\">navigated</span>, then the\n+       navigation will be done with <span>replacement enabled</span>.</p></dd>",
